      },
      "what_to_do": {
        "text": "Ask a controls technician to compare the economizer setpoint with the design sequence.",
        "source": "title24-econ-fdd"
      },
      "definition": {
        "text": "The economizer enable setpoint offset by -4, -2, +2 and +4 °C from the correct 10 °C.",
        "source": "lbnl-rtu"
      },
      "observed": {
        "text": "Inconsistent across seasons on daily medians. Only hours with outdoor air between the correct and the wrong setpoint can show it, so held-out evidence is thin.",
