      "observed": {
        "text": "Outdoor-air fraction about 0.86 to 0.91 when stuck fully open and 0.48 to 0.57 at 50%, against 0.21 to 0.40 fault-free. Stuck at 5% or 10% looks like a damper resting at its minimum position.",
